@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix omn: <http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#>.

_:B95809b22e12a207c2bd3e759c43764d6 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#members> (omn:Attribute
                                                                             omn:Component
                                                                             omn:Dependency
                                                                             omn:Environment
                                                                             omn:Group
                                                                             omn:Layer
                                                                             omn:Resource
                                                                             omn:Service).
<http://alex.willner.ws/about#me> a <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn> <http://creativecommons.org/ns#license> <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>;
